OL,3,GNEWSAThe teen fossil hunter who was
OL,4,Atrapped in a cave
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen a teenager went to a chalk cave to
OL,7,Fhunt for fossils, little did he know he
OL,8,Fwould become part of a remarkable
OL,9,Fchapter in a Surrey village history.
OL,11,FThe Westhumble cave, located in the
OL,12,FNorth Downs near Dorking, was once
OL,13,Fmined for its chalk.
OL,15,FIn February 1954, four adventurous
OL,16,Fyoungsters - including Fred Topliffe -
OL,17,Ffrom London wanted to explore the site.
OL,19,FPete Brown, from Dorking Museum, told
OL,20,FSecret Surrey that the 15-year-old was
OL,21,Finterested in geology.
